Changes in this package
-----------------------
- src/maia3.ts: a reimplementation of the Maia-3 network's inference
  (input encoding, transformer with geometric attention bias, policy and value
  heads) in dependency-free TypeScript, ported from the upstream PyTorch code.
- src/worker.ts: an optional Web Worker wrapper.
- weights/maia3-5m.int8.bin: the Maia3-5M checkpoint converted to a single
  file, with large matrices quantized to per-row int8 and the remaining
  tensors to float16 (tools/export_weights.py; details in
  weights/manifest.json).
- test/reference.json: outputs of the upstream PyTorch model, generated by
  tools/export_weights.py, used to test the port.
